(text "RGB V6 only: VIH=0.55*VDD; U10 switches VSYS with PWR_EN.\nBlank RGB below VBAT about3.6V under load; limit current to15mA.\nRGB not guaranteed when LED_VDD<3.3V. I2C 3.3V/4.7k; SD SPI initially<=12.5MHz." (at 258 245 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "523e9c86-87fe-5c98-b067-a1c19cc63c19"))
